    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> the area placed is a barrier: the cage or box stops creatures and can be seen through. The cage's bars are treated as the box is: nothing passes. Walls are made for it by the GM's client, and removed when the spell ends. It changes no item: midi applies it to any item with the identifier <code>forcecage</code> (2024 rules) that nothing else automates.</p>",
